                                                "text": "a claim of ownership"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0920e0d6-0fd0-402b-ab73-d085691a107f",
                                                "sense_id": "970f7e4f-15fd-329e-9ed7-82c6c07c5133",
                                                "text": "a claim of victory"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "28df3f02-5bb8-3c23-9b09-9c5b84674041",
                                        "entry_id": "a4e64be1-ff56-3d43-b368-016841e0dc54",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The thing claimed."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a6e654f5-f1db-355c-b54c-b608413f76fb",
                                        "entry_id": "a4e64be1-ff56-3d43-b368-016841e0dc54",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The right or ground of demanding."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c05dc20f-f7fa-420c-96f4-0323f18d6eb0",
                                                "sense_id": "a6e654f5-f1db-355c-b54c-b608413f76fb",
                                                "text": "You don't have any claim on my time, since I'm no longer your employee."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8cc27dbf-e3fc-36d1-88f6-39384678a003",
                                        "entry_id": "a4e64be1-ff56-3d43-b368-016841e0dc54",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A new statement of something one believes to be the truth, usually when the statement has yet to be verified or without valid evidence provided."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4f4a7d3c-d40a-41e5-8652-1c0faf75ec52",
                                                "sense_id": "8cc27dbf-e3fc-36d1-88f6-39384678a003",
                                                "text": "The company's share price dropped amid claims of accounting fraud."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "acc758da-f75b-4e2b-a885-e4772f6a743c",
                                                "sense_id": "8cc27dbf-e3fc-36d1-88f6-39384678a003",
                                                "text": "Bailey, in using accents, felt that he was 'directing to their proper pronuntiation' and showing 'the Orthoepia of the English Tongue' (title page, Dictionarium Britannicum, 1730 edition). The claim is ridiculous."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d78a08c-2e69-4174-92d9-59dcafdb7bda",
                                                "sense_id": "8cc27dbf-e3fc-36d1-88f6-39384678a003",
                                                "text": "The thing is, we've even had formal confirmation from Government itself that the crucial research required to make such sweeping claims hasn't been done!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e4b5041-fb32-36f2-b98c-2a269c0e3d40",
                                        "entry_id": "a4e64be1-ff56-3d43-b368-016841e0dc54",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A demand of ownership for previously unowned land."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "501a61d1-2328-4163-b8a4-a40c7bf51ae2",
                                                "sense_id": "9e4b5041-fb32-36f2-b98c-2a269c0e3d40",
                                                "text": "Miners had to stake their claims during the gold rush."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aaf27170-6297-3703-ab95-24ca2f0e8d2f",
                                        "entry_id": "a4e64be1-ff56-3d43-b368-016841e0dc54",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A legal demand for compensation or damages."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "claim",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6511cfd3-b217-39e6-b544-a9aa31bb4dcd",
                                        "entry_id": "79dfc152-2f6c-3877-a75d-6b05cc2c6ee7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To demand ownership of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62522dee-6113-4aab-9f9b-629665d6bdf8",
                                                "sense_id": "6511cfd3-b217-39e6-b544-a9aa31bb4dcd",
                                                "text": "Jeffrey Chuang, an economics student at University College London, said: \"I am for independence. I do not think China has any right to claim Taiwan. We have confidence in our country and we know that China is not capable of doing anything to us.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3adb6297-f1cb-3db2-bf22-e3e6d1e94e13",
                                        "entry_id": "79dfc152-2f6c-3877-a75d-6b05cc2c6ee7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To state a new fact, typically without providing evidence to prove it is true."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "78f9ed72-8ea2-312f-b137-557b1135099f",
                                        "entry_id": "79dfc152-2f6c-3877-a75d-6b05cc2c6ee7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To demand ownership or right to use for land."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2151380c-b601-392e-8148-6f8da845b514",
                                        "entry_id": "79dfc152-2f6c-3877-a75d-6b05cc2c6ee7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To demand compensation or damages through the courts."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2a820f52-3e84-338d-8038-0b342a578868",
                                        "entry_id": "79dfc152-2f6c-3877-a75d-6b05cc2c6ee7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To be entitled to anything; to deduce a right or title; to have a claim."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "79b46072-2147-4c08-b869-b8796ee8e578",
                                                "sense_id": "2a820f52-3e84-338d-8038-0b342a578868",
                                                "text": "We must know how the first ruler, from whom any one claims, came by his authority, upon what ground any one has empire"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "be9d2e2d-beac-33d6-903b-c1de3f451683",
                                        "entry_id": "79dfc152-2f6c-3877-a75d-6b05cc2c6ee7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To cause the loss of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ebb2733-2489-4da3-a086-810d1a32b4a5",
                                                "sense_id": "be9d2e2d-beac-33d6-903b-c1de3f451683",
                                                "text": "The attacks claimed the lives of five people."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66a36961-cff5-49b7-a284-45f1c409baba",
                                                "sense_id": "be9d2e2d-beac-33d6-903b-c1de3f451683",
                                                "text": "A fire claimed two homes."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d3c774d3-fe0b-3e61-be14-6af1d2465bce",
                                        "entry_id": "79dfc152-2f6c-3877-a75d-6b05cc2c6ee7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To win as a prize in a sport or competition."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a6ef12df-a2c3-4ac7-b7d2-11d606b166da",
                                                "sense_id": "d3c774d3-fe0b-3e61-be14-6af1d2465bce",
                                                "text": "He claimed $100 after winning the top spot."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fbde0cf2-5af2-3418-b227-d6c0344eaaf6",
                                        "entry_id": "79dfc152-2f6c-3877-a75d-6b05cc2c6ee7",
                                        "glosses": [
